<title>AUSTRALIA: Deutsche scales Australian funds league.</title>
<headline>Deutsche scales Australian funds league.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell (DMG), a unit of Deutsche Bank Ag, said on Friday the acquisition of Axiom funds management would make it one of Australia's top five of fund managers measured by funds under management.</p>
<p>Prior to the A$240 million purchase, DMG had no local wholesale funds management business.</p>
<p>&quot;This puts us into the top five fund managers in Australia,&quot; DMG Australia managing director John Barnes told Reuters.</p>
<p>Barnes said the group would also transfer DMG's A$500 million to A$700 million Australian equities funds management business from London to Sydney as part of the deal.</p>
